This project is an independent implementation.

The design of the physics layer is *inspired by* the problem space explored by
Sable (https://github.com/ryanhcode/sable) -- namely, rigid-body simulation of
moving block structures built from voxel collision shapes. No source code,
class layout, comment text, or resource file from Sable or from any Sable port
was copied into this repository. Ideas, public Minecraft/Fabric APIs, and
general physics techniques (greedy voxel meshing, compound colliders,
fixed-timestep integration, interpolated rendering poses) are not copyrightable
and were implemented from scratch.

